# Approval

Do not run the packing pipeline (or missing-run / preflight writes the supervisor did not ask for) against live Input/Output unless they already said **yes / do it / fill / run**.

Propose settings (date, shift, workbook, image dirs) first when unclear. Do not invent CL matches for unmatched SKUs without approval.
